00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:09.714
That we see where we have been more reachable,
and we have been more accessible when

00:00:09.714 --> 00:00:17.000
it comes to the demography that currently
are directly accessing our programs.

00:00:17.000 --> 00:00:26.905
One thing to understand is we need also
to increase participants from other

00:00:26.905 --> 00:00:33.000
demographics. This includes people
with disability and also

00:00:33.000 --> 00:00:41.909
refugees, and anyone that can access these
programs and can directly benefit from

00:00:41.909 --> 00:00:47.000
the outcomes of tech training, and also take

00:00:47.000 --> 00:00:59.000
take opportunities, talent opportunities.
And we firmly believe that tech

00:00:59.000 --> 00:01:01.000
technical education is

00:01:01.000 --> 00:01:09.667
the ultimate equalizer. Because, let's say,
for someone that wants to directly

00:01:09.667 --> 00:01:17.000
get a job opportunity currently,
in one way or another,

00:01:17.000 --> 00:01:21.800
physical appearance and also their
demography directly impacts. And that is a

00:01:21.800 --> 00:01:28.600
general truth that we want to try to change.
But when it comes to tech talent, one

00:01:28.600 --> 00:01:33.000
thing that it gives you is this
equalization. Because once you

00:01:33.000 --> 00:01:41.615
equip yourself with exceptional tech talent,
then you can directly be hired remotely,

00:01:41.615 --> 00:01:49.000
and you will be evaluated by your technical
capabilities and technical delivery.

00:01:49.000 --> 00:01:55.000
So, we want that to happen,
and we want this to be the truth

00:01:55.000 --> 00:02:06.667
for Ethiopian youth with disability,
and also Ethiopian youth that are refugees and

00:02:06.667 --> 00:02:10.000
also internally displaced.

00:02:10.000 --> 00:02:17.391
So, our vision is to make our platform...
If you are an ALX student, you

00:02:17.391 --> 00:02:20.000
have interacted with our platform.

00:02:20.000 --> 00:02:24.000
We have a platform that

00:02:24.000 --> 00:02:31.500
has trained thousands of students, and
it's been used across the globe.

00:02:31.500 --> 00:02:39.000
Now, what we are trying to do
is to make it accessible for everyone.
